IMPORTANT LEGAL NOTICE:

This software is designed for LEGITIMATE, CONSENSUAL employee monitoring
in compliance with applicable privacy laws (GDPR, CCPA, etc.).

DO NOT use this software for:
- Covert surveillance
- Keystroke logging
- Webcam/microphone access
- Personal device monitoring
- Any purpose violating privacy laws

Before deployment, you MUST:
1. Complete a Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA)
2. Obtain works council/union approval (where required)
3. Deploy the Monitoring Policy to employees
4. Obtain explicit, informed consent from each employee
5. Configure privacy controls (smart blur, work hours, pause limits)

The authors accept NO LIABILITY for misuse of this software.
Users are responsible for ensuring their deployment complies with all applicable laws.